The '''Campfire''' is one of the eleven workbench types in ''[[Human Host]]''.

Early-tier utility station. Cooking is planned but not yet in the current build.

Internal enum value: <code>WorkbenchType.Campfire</code> (assembly <code>UI</code>). Prefab: <code>WB_Campfire</code>.

